IntentExecutionPolicy::setWhitelistedTargets
├── given caller is owner
│   ├── when adding a single target
│   │   ├── it should set whitelistedTargets[target] to true
│   │   └── it should emit TargetWhitelisted(target, true)
│   ├── when removing a single target
│   │   ├── it should set whitelistedTargets[target] to false
│   │   └── it should emit TargetWhitelisted(target, false)
│   ├── when adding multiple targets
│   │   └── it should set whitelistedTargets to true for all entries
│   └── when mixing adds and removes
│       └── it should apply each entry correctly
└── given caller is not owner
    └── it should revert
